{"id":1050802,"name":"보투르.블루·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"보투르.블루·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1050802]}],"trial":{"trial_id":50802,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2024-12-31 14:00:00","diary1":"보투르.블루가 편지에서 언급한 레만은 디스 변방에서 아주 가까운 곳에 있었고, 이는 분쟁이 임박했음을 의미했다.\n　　당신은 최악의 상황이 발생하기 전에 레만을 구하기 위해 서둘러 각 부서에 연락을 취했다.","diary2":"보투르.블루 역시 디스 변방에 울려 퍼진 총성을 들은 듯했다. 생각에 잠겨있던 보투르.블루가 놀라 정신을 차렸고, 이내 부하 직원이 새로운 방문객이 찾아왔다는 소식을 전했다.\n　　그 순간, 문득 예감이 들었다. 그녀는 저항하지 않고 FAC를 따라 디스로 돌아가 조사에 협조하고, 오래전부터 예상했던 결말을 마주하기로 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260677,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260678,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150802022,"next":null},{"step":23,"cou